// A place the story reaches later: its ground, its shape against the sky and a mark, and no door.
// The `butterfly_forest_door` slot in its face is where data/doors.json sets one once the place behind it
// exists; until then the face is blank, because a locked door with nothing behind it would be a lie.
id      butterfly_forest
box     30x24
anchor  centre
face    s
gates   s15, w12, e12
slots   butterfly_forest_door 14 7
grid
